# PC Power Calculator — env var surface
#
# GA4 Measurement ID for pcpower.concreteinfo.co.in.
# Create a GA4 property at https://analytics.google.com, copy the
# G-XXXXXXXXXX ID, set it here, and rebuild. Empty by default = GA4
# fully disabled (privacy-respecting default).
#
# VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# --- Search-engine verification (build-time meta tags) ---
# Copy the token from Google Search Console (HTML tag method) and Bing
# Webmaster Tools. Empty = no tag is emitted; a value injects
# <meta name="google-site-verification" …> / <meta name="msvalidate.01" …>
# into the built pages. Rebuild after changing either.
#
VITE_GSC_VERIFICATION=
VITE_BING_VERIFICATION=

# --- Outbound mail (server/mail.mjs) ---
# Credentials live only in the deployment environment; never commit values.
# A missing SMTP_USER/SMTP_PASSWORD makes the API answer 500 "Email is not
# configured" rather than silently dropping submissions.
SMTP_HOST=smtp.hostinger.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=

# Where notifications land and the envelope sender.
MAIL_TO=support@concreteinfo.in
MAIL_FROM=noreply@concreteinfo.co.in

# Links used in the branded email template.
APP_URL=https://pcpower.concreteinfo.co.in
SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@concreteinfo.in
COMPANY_URL=https://www.concreteinfo.in
LINKEDIN_URL=https://in.linkedin.com/company/concreteinfo
YOUTUBE_URL=https://www.youtube.com/@concreteinfo6736